  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0020_76dd01b62936.png\"><br>\r\n\r\n$$\r\n\r\n\\text { Area }=\\int_{0}^{2 \\pi / 3}(\\cos x-\\cos 2 x) d x=\\frac{3 \\sqrt{3}}{4}\r\n\r\n$$"
  }
